\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, the First And Last,
\par On Thee my soul is cast:
\par Thou didst Thy work begin
\par By blotting out my sin;
\par Thou wilt the root remove,
\par And perfect me in love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Yet when the work is done,
\par The work is but begun:
\par Partaker of Thy grace,
\par I long to see Thy face;
\par The first I prove below,
\par The last I die to know.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

